- **XValkyrie** ([sammwyy/xvalkyrie](https://github.com/sammwyy/xvalkyrie), GPL-3.0): ACP/`AcpHal` client in `tools/gdk-host` and Xbox descriptor / CPU-upload modules in `tools/devicex-proxy` are adapted under GPL-3.0-or-later with §5(a) modification notices. See [LICENSES/PROVENANCE.md](LICENSES/PROVENANCE.md).
- **VIctory** ([Marvisak/VIctory](https://github.com/Marvisak/VIctory), GPL-3.0-or-later): Consulted for Xbox GDK runtime ABI facts (`QueryApiImpl` GUIDs, offline `XUser`/`XNetworking`/`GameInput`/`DirectStorage` layouts, and deferred PSO patterns). No source code copied; reimplemented modules are GPL-3.0-or-later. See [LICENSES/PROVENANCE.md](LICENSES/PROVENANCE.md).
- **AMD AddrLib** ([GPUOpen-Drivers/pal](https://github.com/GPUOpen-Drivers/pal), MIT): GFX10/RDNA2 swizzle patterns ported in `tools/detile` and `tools/texture-boot`.
- **Mesa3D** ([mesa/mesa](https://gitlab.freedesktop.org/mesa/mesa), MIT): GFX10 resource-descriptor format tables used as reference data.
- **LLVM / AMDGPU** ([llvm.org](https://llvm.org/), Apache-2.0 with LLVM-exception): External disassembler used for decoder verification.
- **xcl** ([ivall/xcl](https://github.com/ivall/xcl), GPL-2.0-only) and **ScarlettX** ([Freminet/ScarlettX](https://github.com/Freminet/ScarlettX)): Consulted for published console ABI/layout documentation only; no code integrated.

